      "claim": "No closure exoneration is available on this record. The only traffic advisory in the bundle, EV-ADVIS-00512-01, is MISSING: no advisory covers the optimal corridor in this window, its weight is 0.0 and it carries no payload. POL-RD-03 therefore cannot be run, and not one metre of the 2.82 km excess is exonerated. The absence is itself citable, and I cite it.",
      "side": "RIDER",
