      "claim": "The driver's explanation — that his phone hung — is a general assertion pointing to no artifact and no clause. POL-RD-08 shifts the burden to the driver to identify a specific artifact and a specific clause, and provides that unsupported assertions carry no weight; the empty chat log EV-CHAT-00512 leaves his account uncorroborated on the record, while the trace's 8.92 km stands against him.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
